# 👤 Employee Avatars Info

This folder contains the profile pictures used for the **Employee Profile** page in the dashboard.

## 🛡️ Privacy & Source
To keep this portfolio project completely safe and compliant with privacy laws (like GDPR), I did not use photos of real people.

*   **Source:** All photos were sourced from [UI Faces](https://uifaces.co).
*   **Type:** They are **Human AI Avatars**—entirely generated by artificial intelligence. 

These faces do not belong to any real individuals, allowing me to showcase a dynamic employee directory features without any privacy concerns.
